# B. menu navigation, through to MAP SELECT.
# The host's script parser accumulates `wait` into a pending counter and
# flushes it into the NEXT press entry, so the total scripted length is
# 250+5+80+5+80+5 = 425 frames and the trailing `wait 400` is dropped.
# RUN_FRAMES is 825 anyway: the map needs 400 frames after the last B to
# finish drawing before the screenshot is taken.
wait 250
press start 5
wait 80
press down 5
wait 80
press b 5
wait 400
